1100
00:59:35,804 --> 00:59:36,424
The proposal.

1101
00:59:37,164 --> 00:59:41,844
Fund Org Name at a five thousand dollar baseline plus a per-voter rate (anchor:

1102
00:59:42,124 --> 00:59:46,664
one dollar, negotiable) up to a delivery target of target voters within

1103
00:59:46,664 --> 00:59:47,614
timeframe.

